<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 384 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 384 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, in reply to Australia's first innings 243 all out, were 384 all out on the third day of the fifth and final test at the WACA Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 243 (Michael Bevan 87 not out, Mark Waugh 79, Curtly Ambrose five for 43); West Indies 384 all out (Brian Lara 132, Robert Samuels 76).</p>
